00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:49.590
Malicious Glymph has taken Leo Tolstoy's very long story War and Peace

00:23:49.590 --> 00:23:52.610
and turned it into a very long television series.

00:23:53.040 --> 00:23:57.300
Set in the elaborate and extremely long world of 19th century Russia,

00:23:57.540 --> 00:23:59.980
it tells at great length the story...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:04.920
of people caught up in the monumental and long Napoleonic Wars. Filmed

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:09.860
expensively on location in Rutland, you can see the might and majesty and length

00:24:09.860 --> 00:24:14.740
