00:24:26.940 --> 00:24:29.980
Another puffy actor, Natasha, torn between...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:36.330
her love of close-ups and overacting. This classic love story unfolds amidst

00:24:36.330 --> 00:24:45.060
some of history's most expensive and long scenes. See Moscow in flames and watch

00:24:45.060 --> 00:24:50.200
the appalling horrors of the acting in the retreat from the burning city. All

00:24:50.200 --> 00:24:55.080
this to the noisy music of Tchaikovsky on Rutland Weekend's classically long

00:24:55.080 --> 00:24:57.180
series War and Peace.

